.TH "Docv::TargetKind" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::TargetKind \- What a link leads to.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBenum Docv::TargetKind\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
What a link leads to.
.SH "ENUM MEMBERS"
.TP 4
\fBPage = 0_u8\fR
A manual page: \fB\%Target#location\fR is its name, \fB\%Target#part\fR its
section.
.TP 4
\fBUrl = 1_u8\fR
An absolute URL (\fB\%https:\fR, \fB\%mailto:\fR...) in \fB\%Target#location\fR, left
to the terminal (OSC 8).
.TP 4
\fBFile = 2_u8\fR
A file relative to the document in \fB\%Target#location\fR, with a heading
anchor in \fB\%Target#part\fR (may be empty).
.TP 4
\fBAnchor = 3_u8\fR
A heading of the same document: the anchor in \fB\%Target#part\fR.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/ast.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv" (3cr),
